        "heading_BjTiwk": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "THIS CHANGES EVERYTHING",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_wpJ6YB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Fuss happens… it’s natural. First-of-its-kind SensorySoothe™ technology is here to help — when you’re driving, when your hands are full or you just need time to retreat to a safe, quiet place with your teary, upset infant. Illuminate the car seat with the amber glow of a Parent Light. Cue a mesmerizing light show. Play a favorite lullaby or mask background sounds with white noise perfect for babies.<br/></p><p>While it can never replace your comforting arms, this groundbreaking technology can be a helpful parenting tool in stressful moments. SensorySoothe technology. This changes everything.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
